Case 2: Embedding API shape (no full build in this chapter)
Documentation for embedding lives under The Servo Book → Embedding. The stable ideas:

Depend on the servo library crate (not servoshell).
Drive the engine from your event loop: create a Servo / builder, feed input, composite frames into your windowing stack.
Decide resources: keep default bundled / baked-in-resources, or disable default features and call servo_embedder_traits::submit_resource_reader with your own ResourceReader (OpenHarmony’s filesystem reader is the cited pattern upstream).
